{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11thシングル、『命は美しい』が\nなーちゃんが出演した\nオールナイトニッポンで解禁されましたが\nみなさん聴いてくれましたか？\nそれとなーちゃんソロ曲のカップリングも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに 11th新制服も解禁です♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲については言えることは\nとにかくダンスが激しくてカッコいいのと\nMVの仕上がりも、凄い。\n早くみなさんに観てもらいたいなぁ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週の京都、アルバム握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早朝、ロケバスの集合時間より\nちょっと早く降りてきちゃったから\nみんなを待ってる間に\nみなみちゃんと一緒に琵琶湖にお散歩。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも風が吹き荒れすぎ(；；)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一部の衣装\n2ndシングル  おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人で踊っていると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏が来てくれましたー！\nぐるカーとおいシャンのコラボ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二部\n5thシングル   君の名は希望"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休憩で食べたたこ焼き♪\nめっちゃ好きやねん(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三部\n4thシングル  制服のマネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョンソンことあみと♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーラー服、まだいけますか。\nもう一回着たいから\n名古屋でもどこかの部で着ちゃうかも？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四部\n10thアンダー\nあの日僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはずっしりとしていて重い分\nスカートが綺麗にヒラヒラとなって\n可愛いの！\n着たのは生写真以来です(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"五部\n8thシングル  気づいたら片想い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅんの衣装を借りたんで\nまっちゅんも映ってくれました〜♡\nちなみに撮影者はまいやん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都のみなさんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755に書いていたクイズの正解は"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんでした！\nこんな無防備に赤ちゃんみたいに\nスヤスヤ眠るさゆりん、可愛すぎ。\n私は家出たら、帰るまでは\n爆睡できないタイプだから羨ましい(*'.'*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Happy Birthday！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん、さゆりん、みさ、ななみん\n92年組がやっと\n22歳に揃いました(*^^*)\nラーメンが大好物な、ななみん！\nいつも仲良くしてくれてありがとう！\nまた一緒に食べに行きたいなぁ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃは19歳。\n最近二人でグラビアを撮らせて頂いて\nどうやったらみさみたいに\nオトナっぽくなれるの？\nって真面目に聞いてきたまりかがが\n可愛かった。(誕生日だから褒めてあげる)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして次は、いよいよ\n乃木坂46のバースデー。\nいよいよ明日がラストのリハーサルです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前代未聞の約7時間半ライブ。\n初のドームでのライブ。\nスカパー中継もさせて頂いたり、\n会場に来れない方もたくさん\n観てくださると思いますし\n全国各地から観に来てくださる方も\nたくさんいらっしゃると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安で押しつぶされそうですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、乃木坂46、3歳のお誕生日を\nファンのみんなとお祝いできる幸せが\nもうすぐそこにあるのかと思うと\n楽しみで仕方ありません！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにお願いです(*^^*)\n本当に極寒の中の長時間ライブになるので\n防寒をしっっっかりしてくださいね！\nライブで盛り上がってきて\n暑くて脱いじゃうくらいが理想です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆んなで良いものを作れるように\n一丸となって頑張ります！\n会場でお待ちしています(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野球大好き！集まれ！侍ジャパン\n観てくださいね(*^^*)\nhttp://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/125782/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではおやすみさみさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/02/21/4448168/0014.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}